305	// Trail #1003 finding: resolveRepoCellPlacement was the one cell-resolution
306	// entry point with no deadline, and the coreapi HTTP client sets only a dial
307	// timeout — so a reachable-but-slow control plane stalled `explain --repo`
308	// indefinitely, before its spinner had even started. The parent deadline here
309	// is shorter than requiredCellResolveTimeout, which is what keeps this test
